<Project Type="Project" LVVersion="14008000">
	<Property Name="NI.LV.All.SourceOnly" Type="Bool">false</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Project.Description" Type="Str">This example demonstrates how to use callback VIs to handle interrupts on the myRIO target. The interrupt source includes analog input, digital input, button, and timer. This example also demonstrates the differences between callback VIs when they use one CPU and two CPUs.</Property>
